# desc: 차이를 「설계선택·최적화」 논거로 메운 판단과 그 청구항은? (결손 design-choice-rationale)
# suite: pa
# monotone: up
# expect-min: 1
PREFIX pa:   <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/>
PREFIX pakr: <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/kr/>
SELECT DISTINCT ?j ?claim
WHERE { ?j pa:supportedBy ?set ; pa:judgesClaim ?claim . ?set pa:hasRationale pa:RationaleDesignChoice . }
ORDER BY ?j ?claim
